pe":["Typ \u00faryvku"],"PHP":["PHP"],"CSS":["CSS"],"JavaScript":["JavaScript"],"Snippet code":["K\u00f3d \u00faryvku"],"PHP code only - do not include the opening <?php tag. Code is validated (syntax + duplicate declarations) before it is saved.":["Jen PHP k\u00f3d - nevkl\u00e1dejte \u00favodn\u00ed zna\u010dku <?php. K\u00f3d se p\u0159ed ulo\u017een\u00edm validuje (syntaxe + duplicitn\u00ed deklarace)."],"Where to run":["Kde spou\u0161t\u011bt"],"Enable snippet":["Zapnout \u00faryvek"],"Update snippet":["Aktualizovat \u00faryvek"],"Save snippet":["Ulo\u017eit \u00faryvek"],"Back to list":["Zp\u011bt na seznam"],"Code Snippets":["\u00daryvky k\u00f3du"],"Snippets":["\u00daryvky"],"From":["Od"],"Login state":["Stav p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed"],"Condition type":["Typ podm\u00ednky"],"Logged in":["P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00fd"],"Logged out":["Nep\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00fd"],"Invert":["Opa\u010dn\u011b"],"Remove condition":["Odebrat podm\u00ednku"],"Add condition":["P\u0159idat podm\u00ednku"],"Shortcode (insert it where you want the output)":["Shortcode (vlo\u017ete ho tam, kde chcete v\u00fdstup)"],"Before the post content":["P\u0159ed obsahem p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku"],"After the post content":["Za obsahem p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku"],"Run once (on the next admin page, then it switches itself off)":["Spustit jednou (na dal\u0161\u00ed str\u00e1nce administrace, pak se s\u00e1m vypne)"],"Before content":["P\u0159ed obsahem"],"After content":["Za obsahem"],"Run once":["Spustit jednou"],"Ran":["Spu\u0161t\u011bno"],"Waiting for the next admin page":["\u010cek\u00e1 na dal\u0161\u00ed str\u00e1nku administrace"],"Where":["Kde"],"Inserted around the content of a single post or page (not in lists of posts), only for the chosen post types.":["Vlo\u017e\u00ed se okolo obsahu jednoho p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku nebo str\u00e1nky (ne ve v\u00fdpisech p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f), jen pro vybran\u00e9 typy obsahu."],"The shortcode appears after the snippet is saved: [uxstudio_snippet id=\"...\"]. PHP snippets get the shortcode attributes as $atts and the enclosed text as $content, and do not run in REST, AJAX or cron requests.":["Shortcode se objev\u00ed po ulo\u017een\u00ed snippetu: [uxstudio_snippet id=\"...\"]. PHP snippety dostanou atributy shortcodu jako $atts a vlo\u017een\u00fd text jako $content a nespou\u0161t\u011bj\u00ed se v po\u017eadavc\u00edch REST, AJAX ani cron."],"When you enable the snippet, its code runs one time on the next page of wp-admin and the snippet switches itself off. Enable it again to run it once more.":["Po zapnut\u00ed snippetu se jeho k\u00f3d jednou provede na dal\u0161\u00ed str\u00e1nce administrace a snippet se s\u00e1m vypne. Dal\u0161\u00edm zapnut\u00edm ho spust\u00edte znovu."],"wp-admin":["wp-admin"],"Type of page":["Typ str\u00e1nky"],"Specific posts or pages":["Konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky nebo str\u00e1nky"],"Visitor login state":["Stav p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edka"],"Time window":["\u010casov\u00e9 okno"],"Front page":["\u00davodn\u00ed str\u00e1nka"],"Posts page":["Str\u00e1nka p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f"],"Single post or page":["Jednotliv\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek nebo str\u00e1nka"],"Author page":["Str\u00e1nka autora"],"Search results":["V\u00fdsledky vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Run conditions (optional)":["Podm\u00ednky spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed (voliteln\u00e9)"],"The snippet runs only where all conditions hold, on top of the place chosen above. A PHP snippet with a page or post condition is loaded after the request is parsed (the \"wp\" action), so hooks it adds earlier, such as init, do not fire.":["Snippet se spust\u00ed jen tam, kde plat\u00ed v\u0161echny podm\u00ednky, nav\u00edc k m\u00edstu zvolen\u00e9mu v\u00fd\u0161e. PHP snippet s podm\u00ednkou str\u00e1nky nebo p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku se na\u010dte a\u017e po zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed po\u017eadavku (akce \u201ewp\u201c), tak\u017ee h\u00e1\u010dky, kter\u00e9 p\u0159id\u00e1 d\u0159\u00edv, nap\u0159\u00edklad init, se nespust\u00ed."],"Single posts":["Jednotliv\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky"],"Post type archive":["Archiv typu obsahu"],"Both":["Oboj\u00ed"],"Post or page ids":["ID p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f nebo str\u00e1nek"],"ids, e.g. 12, 45":["ID, nap\u0159. 12, 45"],"Run conditions":["Podm\u00ednky spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed"],"Warning: $atts holds text typed by whoever can write the shortcode into a post (authors, contributors). Never pass it to eval(), include, SQL, shell commands or unescaped output; validate and escape every value first.":["Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed: $atts obsahuje text, kter\u00fd zadal ka\u017ed\u00fd, kdo sm\u00ed shortcode vlo\u017eit do p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku (auto\u0159i, p\u0159isp\u011bvatel\u00e9). Nikdy ho nep\u0159ed\u00e1vejte do eval(), include, SQL, p\u0159\u00edkaz\u016f shellu ani do neescapovan\u00e9ho v\u00fdstupu; ka\u017edou hodnotu nejd\u0159\u00edv ov\u011b\u0159te a escapujte."]}}}